# Oscillating (Dirichlet) series: ucas DECLARES THESE DIVERGENT (WRONG).
sum(n,1,inf,sin(n)/n)
sum(n,1,inf,cos(n)/n)
sum(n,1,inf,sin(n)/n^(1/2))
sum(n,1,inf,sin(2*n)/n)
sum(n,1,inf,(-1)^n*sin(n)/n)
converge sin(n)/n
converge cos(n)/n
converge sin(n)/n^(1/2)
converge sin(2*n)/n
converge (-1)^n*sin(n)/n
# Absolutely convergent oscillatory series (these are handled correctly)
sum(n,1,inf,sin(n)/n^2)
sum(n,1,inf,cos(n)/n^2)
sum(n,1,inf,sin(n)/n^3)
converge sin(n)/log(n)
